Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:02:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(state): record refresh custody and bounded caller
 provenance [daveey]

Prospective observability repair only; earlier producer attribution remains unproven. Existing custody events omit refresh and invoking call sites, so even first-flush refusal cannot correlate every ownership operation. Add real refresh rowcount plus bounded code-location chains to existing transaction/settlement events; no ownership or persistence policy changes.

Proof: unchanged-base first-assistant/tool-round gate fixture fails 6 cases at absent refresh event; patched fixture passes 6. Eight existing consumer suites pass 221 tests. Missing/mismatch refuse before dispatcher and UI, valid flush persists once across repeat; zero-row refresh never recreates ownership. Full scripts/check passes. No live fault injection, prompt or credential values recorded.
